    "text": "If the rms value of the voltage of the waveform shown below is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfrac><mi>p</mi><mi>q</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>, then what is the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>? (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>q</mi></math>&nbsp;are the smallest positive integers.)<br />\r<br />\r<b><u><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0024566_Question.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 261px; height: 129px;\" /></u></b>",
    "image": null
  },
